      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sharon_Center%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s heart is a large traffic circle where a park sits, complete with a gazebo and memorials honoring veterans of many wars.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
